{'symbol': 'HES', 'date': '2023-01-25 07:30:00', 'title': 'HESS REPORTS ESTIMATED RESULTS FOR THE FOURTH QUARTER OF 2022', 'text': 'NEW YORK--( BUSINESS WIRE )--\xa0\xa0\xa0HESS CORPORATION (NYSE: HES) TODAY REPORTED NET INCOME OF $624 MILLION, OR $2.03 PER COMMON SHARE, IN THE FOURTH QUARTER OF 2022 COMPARED WITH NET INCOME OF $265 MILLION, OR $0.85 PER COMMON SHARE, IN THE FOURTH QUARTER OF 2021. ON AN ADJUSTED BASIS, THE CORPORATION HAD NET INCOME OF $548 MILLION OR $1.78 PER COMMON SHARE IN THE FOURTH QUARTER OF 2022. THE IMPROVEMENT IN ADJUSTED AFTER-TAX EARNINGS COMPARED WITH THE PRIOR-YEAR PERIOD WAS PRIMARILY DUE TO INCREASED SALES VOLUMES IN GUYANA IN THE FOURTH QUARTER OF 2022.'}